def tab(headers,data):return '| '+' | '.join(headers)+' |\n| '+' | '.join(['---']*len(headers))+' |\n'+'\n'.join('| '+' | '.join(str(x).replace('|','/') for x in r)+' |' for r in data)+'\n'
